RESULT SLR ACCEPTED steps=61
RESULT LALR ACCEPTED steps=61
RESULT CLR ACCEPTED steps=61
TREE SLR: [Stmt if ( a ) [Stmt if ( b ) [Stmt x = 1 ;] else [Stmt x = 2 ;]]]
